source CauldronPromos
name Cauldron Promos

villain Anathema
name Anathema
from CauldronBase
challenge Regenerative Biology
At the start of the game, put Biofeedback into play.
Biofeedback is indestructible.
Anathema is immune to villain damage.

variant EvolvedAnathema
name Evolved Anathema
from CauldronBase CauldronPromos
base Anathema
challenge True Evolution
Replace both instances of arm or head card on this card with villain target.

villain Celadroch
name Celadroch
from CauldronStormfall
challenge Shallow Slumber
At the start of the game, put a token in the storm pool.

villain Dendron
name Dendron
from CauldronBase
challenge Infernal Ink
Whenever a tattoo enters play, it deals the hero target with the highest HP (H) minus 2 infernal damage.

variant WindcolorDendron
name Windcolor Dendron
from CauldronBase CauldronPromos
base Dendron
challenge Chaotic Colors
At the start of the game, put 6 random tattoos under Dendron instead. Dendron is immune to villain damage.

villain Dynamo
name Dynamo
from CauldronAdrift
challenge Camaraderie
At the start of the game, put Python and Copperhead into play. Dynamo is indestructible as long as there is another villain target in play.

villain Gray
name Gray
from CauldronBase
challenge Decaying World
At the start of the villain turn, Gray deals each target 1 irreducable energy damage.

villain TheInfernalChoir
name The Infernal Choir
from CauldronAdrift
challenge Concealed Soul
When The Infernal Choir flips, reduce damage dealt to The Infernal Choir by 2 until the start of the villain turn.

villain Menagerie
name Menagerie
from CauldronStormfall
challenge Stressful Containment
At the end of the villain turn, the captured hero and each hero next to an enclosure deals themself X irreducable psychic damage, where X is the number of enclosures in play.

villain TheMistressOfFate
name The Mistress of Fate
from CauldronAdrift
challenge Imperfect Loop
When The Mistress of Fate flips to her "Back to the beginning side", immediately discard the top card of the villain deck for each face-down day card.

villain Mythos
name Mythos
from CauldronAdrift
challenge Concealed Plots
You are only allowed to check the symbol on the top card of the villain deck.

villain Oriphel
name Oriphel
from CauldronExperimental
challenge Rigid Rituals
Reduce damage dealt to villain relics by 2.
Oriphel does not flip back to Jade until there are 3 villain relics in the villain trash.

villain Outlander
name Outlander
from CauldronAdrift
challenge Lingering Influence
Whenever a villain ongoing is destroyed, other villain ongoings are indestructible until the end of the villain turn.

villain Phase
name Phase
from CauldronStormfall
challenge Winding Escape Route
Whenever an obstacle is destroyed, obstacles become immune to damage until the end of the turn.

villain TheRam
name The Ram
from CauldronBase
challenge Tactical Retreat
The first time in the game that The Ram is reduced to 40 or fewer HP, search the villain deck and trash for a copy of Fall Back and put it into play, then shuffle all cards other than Up Close and Grappling Claw from the villain trash into the villain deck.

variant Ram1929
name 1929 Ram
from CauldronBase CauldronPromos
base TheRam
challenge Reverse Engineering
At the end of the villain turn, if this card is in play, destroy an equipment card, then put the top card of the villain deck under The Ram.

villain ScreaMachine
name ScreaMachine
from CauldronAdrift
challenge Star Power
Band members flip when 2 cards of their corresponding keyword are in play rather than 3.

villain SwarmEater
name Swarm Eater
from CauldronExperimental
challenge Inescapable Hunter
Whenever Swarm Eater reduces a target to 2 or fewer HP, Swarm Eater destroys that target.

variant HivemindSwarmEater
name Hivemind Swarm Eater
from CauldronExperimental CauldronPromos
base SwarmEater
challenge Shared Code
Activated absorb texts also apply to Swarm Eater.

villain Tiamat
name Tiamat
from CauldronBase
challenge Undying Rage
Whenever a villain spell card enters play, if the head it names is decapitated, that head flips and is restroted to (H) times 3 HP.

variant HydraTiamat
name Hydra Tiamat
from CauldronBase CauldronPromos
base Tiamat
unlock Have The Knight, Necro, and Echelon on the team. Each of base Tiamat's heads must be defeated by its nemesis hero.
requires Tiamat TheKnight? Necro? Echelon?
challenge Resiliance
villain ongoings are indestructible as long as 2 or more heads are not decapitated.

variant Tiamat2199
name Tiamat 2199
from CauldronBase CauldronPromos
base Tiamat
challenge Reactive Armor
Whenever a non-villain target deals damage to a dragonscale, Tiamat deals that target (H) minus 1 projectile damage.

villain Vector
name Vector
from CauldronExperimental
challenge Silent Plague
At the start of the game, put Supervirus under Vector. It does not count as being in play.
The first time Vector would be destroyed each game, instead set him to 10 HP and put Supervirus from under him into play.

